{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29576","headline":"有感二首 一 · 李商隐","name":"有感二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"九服归元化，三灵叶睿图。\n如何本初辈，自取屈氂诛。\n有甚当车泣，因劳下殿趋。\n何成奏云物，直是灭萑苻。\n证逮符书密，辞连性命俱。\n竟缘尊汉相，不早辨胡雏。\n鬼籙分朝部，军烽照上都。\n敢云堪恸哭，未免怨洪炉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李商隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29576.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29576","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}